  docs/DEVELOPING.md:230:./gradlew mergeNativeTraceMetadata \
  docs/DEVELOPING.md-231-  -PinputDirs=<absolute-trace-output-dir-0>,<absolute-trace-output-dir-1>,... \
  docs/DEVELOPING.md-232-  -PoutputDir=<absolute-merged-metadata-dir>
  docs/DEVELOPING.md-233-```
  --
